              "text": "白 — bái — \"white; pale\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "他的手很白 tā de shǒu hěn bái — His hands are very pale."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 白 (bái) — a short fall on top of 日. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
